WEBVTT

00:00:17.652 --> 00:00:20.812
MIRAGE: Hello,
Mr. Incredible.
Nice suit.

00:00:20.892 --> 00:00:22.132
Thanks.

00:00:22.292 --> 00:00:24.972
Nice to be back, Mirage.

00:00:50.852 --> 00:00:54.572
You'll be briefed on
your assignment in the
conference room at 2:00.

00:00:54.652 --> 00:00:56.612
D Wing, room A-113.

00:00:56.692 --> 00:00:58.012
2:00. Got it.

00:00:58.132 --> 00:00:59.652
See you there.

00:01:32.412 --> 00:01:33.572
(GASPS) Edna.

00:01:34.052 --> 00:01:35.372
I'd like to speak
to Edna, please.

00:01:35.492 --> 00:01:36.572
E: This is Edna.

00:01:36.652 --> 00:01:38.052
E? This is Helen.

00:01:38.132 --> 00:01:39.292
Helen who?

00:01:39.412 --> 00:01:42.692
Helen Parr?
You know...

00:01:43.892 --> 00:01:44.892
Elastigirl?

00:01:45.412 --> 00:01:49.172
Darling! It's been such
a long time after all
these years! So long!

00:01:49.252 --> 00:01:50.972
(STAMMERING)
It's been a while.

00:01:51.092 --> 00:01:52.612
There's only one person
Bob would trust

00:01:52.692 --> 00:01:54.372
to patch his supersuit.
That's you.

00:01:54.452 --> 00:01:56.452
Yes, yes, yes.
Marvelous, isn't it?

00:01:56.532 --> 00:01:59.652
Much better than those
horrible pajamas
he used to wear.

00:01:59.732 --> 00:02:02.252
They are finished.
When are you coming
to see?

00:02:02.372 --> 00:02:04.452
I'm calling about...
Don't make me beg.

00:02:04.532 --> 00:02:06.052
I won't do it, you know.
Beg?

00:02:06.412 --> 00:02:08.692
No, I'm calling
about suit.

00:02:08.812 --> 00:02:11.572
(STAMMERING) Bob's suit!
I'm calling about Bob's suit.

00:02:11.692 --> 00:02:15.412
You come in one hour,
darling. I insist, okay?
Okay. Goodbye.

00:02:28.892 --> 00:02:29.932
Hmm.

00:02:34.572 --> 00:02:35.892
(CREAKING)

00:02:46.772 --> 00:02:48.212
SYNDROME: It's bigger!

00:02:50.132 --> 00:02:51.572
It's badder!

00:02:52.892 --> 00:02:58.132
Ladies and gentlemen,
it's too much for
Mr. Incredible!

00:03:00.132 --> 00:03:01.972
It's finally ready.

00:03:02.052 --> 00:03:06.412
You know, I went through
quite a few supers to get
it worthy to fight you,

00:03:06.492 --> 00:03:09.972
but, man,
it wasn't good enough!

00:03:10.052 --> 00:03:11.252
After you trashed
the last one,

00:03:11.332 --> 00:03:14.052
I had to make some
major modifications.

00:03:14.132 --> 00:03:17.252
Sure it was difficult,
but you are worth it.

00:03:17.332 --> 00:03:21.492
I mean, after all,
I am your biggest fan.

00:03:22.972 --> 00:03:23.892
Buddy?

00:03:24.012 --> 00:03:26.572
My name is not Buddy!

00:03:26.652 --> 00:03:28.932
And it's not
Incrediboy either!

00:03:29.012 --> 00:03:32.412
That ship has sailed.
All I wanted was to
help you.

00:03:32.492 --> 00:03:35.812
I only wanted to help!
And what did you say to me?

00:03:36.012 --> 00:03:38.532
Fly home, Buddy.
I work alone.

00:03:38.652 --> 00:03:40.532
SYNDROME:
It tore me apart.

00:03:40.612 --> 00:03:42.332
But I learned
an important lesson.

00:03:42.452 --> 00:03:44.372
You can't count
on anyone.

00:03:44.692 --> 00:03:46.452
Especially your heroes.

00:03:46.532 --> 00:03:49.772
I was wrong to
treat you that way.
I'm sorry.

00:03:49.852 --> 00:03:53.292
See? Now you respect me,
because I'm a threat.

00:03:53.372 --> 00:03:54.812
That's the way it works.

00:03:54.892 --> 00:03:57.652
There's a lot of people,
whole countries
who want respect.

00:03:57.732 --> 00:04:00.292
And they will pay
through the nose
to get it.

00:04:00.372 --> 00:04:01.692
How do you think
I got rich?

00:04:01.772 --> 00:04:03.052
I invented weapons.

00:04:03.132 --> 00:04:05.372
Now I have a weapon
only I can defeat.

00:04:05.492 --> 00:04:07.172
And when I unleash it,
I'll get...

00:04:09.172 --> 00:04:11.972
(LAUGHING) You sly dog!
You got me monologuing.

00:04:12.052 --> 00:04:13.932
I can't believe it.

00:04:15.572 --> 00:04:18.452
It's cool, huh?
Zero-point energy.

00:04:18.932 --> 00:04:21.172
I save the best
inventions for myself.

00:04:22.012 --> 00:04:23.812
Am I good enough now?

00:04:25.212 --> 00:04:26.852
Who's super now?

00:04:26.932 --> 00:04:29.412
I'm Syndrome!
Your nemesis and...

00:04:31.172 --> 00:04:32.732
Oh, brilliant!

00:04:37.692 --> 00:04:39.612
(COUGHING)

00:04:50.332 --> 00:04:53.092
All right, try this one
on for size, big boy.

00:05:12.012 --> 00:05:13.892
(GROANING, SPUTTERING)

00:05:28.452 --> 00:05:30.292
Gazerbeam.

00:05:42.292 --> 00:05:43.692
BOB: Kronos?

